graph TB
    subgraph Agents["🤖 MULTI-AGENT SYSTEM - Agent Types & Responsibilities"]
        
        subgraph GenAgents["📝 GENERATION AGENTS"]
            GA1["Test Generation Agent<br/>AgentExecutor<br/><br/>🎯 Responsibility:<br/>English/Gherkin → Playwright Code<br/>- Convert user stories to BDD<br/>- Generate type-safe selectors<br/>- Validate syntax before saving"]
        end
        
        subgraph ExecAgents["⚙️ EXECUTION AGENTS"]
            EA1["Test Executor Agent<br/>ExecutorService<br/><br/>🎯 Responsibility:<br/>Run tests and capture results<br/>- Launch Playwright CLI<br/>- Capture stdout/stderr<br/>- Parse HTML/JSON reports<br/>- Track execution timeline"]
        end
        
        subgraph OrchestAgents["🤖 ORCHESTRATION AGENTS"]
            OA1["LangChain Orchestrator<br/>with Groq LLM<br/><br/>🎯 Responsibility:<br/>AI-based test management<br/>- Decide: Run vs Heal vs Retry<br/>- Use structured tools<br/>- Manage execution flow<br/>- Handle failures intelligently"]
        end
        
        subgraph HealingAgents["🏥 SELF-HEALING AGENTS"]
            HA1["Failure Detector<br/><br/>🎯 Detects:<br/>✓ Selector not found<br/>✓ Timeout errors<br/>✓ Navigation failures<br/>✓ Assertion mismatches"]
            
            HA2["Failure Analyzer<br/><br/>🎯 Analyzes:<br/>✓ Root cause of failure<br/>✓ Affected elements<br/>✓ Error categories<br/>✓ Fix strategies"]
            
            HA3["Fix Recommender<br/><br/>🎯 Recommends:<br/>✓ Alternative selectors<br/>✓ Wait adjustments<br/>✓ Element recovery<br/>✓ AI-powered fixes"]
            
            HA4["Healing Executor<br/><br/>🎯 Executes:<br/>✓ Apply healed selector<br/>✓ Validate changes<br/>✓ Retry test<br/>✓ Cache results"]
        end
        
        subgraph IntegrationAgents["🔗 INTEGRATION AGENTS"]
            IA1["Jira Connector<br/>jira-routes.ts<br/><br/>🎯 Responsibility:<br/>- Fetch issues from Jira<br/>- Extract test scenarios<br/>- Link results back"]
            
            IA2["MCP Client<br/>Model Context Protocol<br/><br/>🎯 Responsibility:<br/>- Query browser DOM<br/>- Get page structure<br/>- Suggest alternatives<br/>- Real-time analysis"]
            
            IA3["LLM Client<br/>Groq Integration<br/><br/>🎯 Responsibility:<br/>- AI decision making<br/>- Selector recommendations<br/>- Error interpretation<br/>- Test optimization"]
        end
    end
    
    subgraph Coordination["🔄 COORDINATION & DATA FLOW"]
        AC["Agent Communication<br/><br/>✓ Orchestrator directs all agents<br/>✓ Shared data store<br/>✓ Tool-based interaction<br/>✓ Result aggregation"]
        
        DS["🗄️ Shared Data Store<br/><br/>- Test files<br/>- Execution results<br/>- Healed selectors<br/>- Execution timeline"]
    end
    
    GenAgents -.->|Generates tests| DS
    ExecAgents -.->|Stores results| DS
    OrchestAgents -.->|Controls flow| ExecAgents
    OrchestAgents -.->|Triggers healing| HealingAgents
    HealingAgents -.->|Saves fixes| DS
    HealingAgents -.->|Queries| IA2
    HealingAgents -.->|Asks AI| IA3
    IntegrationAgents -.->|Provides data| GenAgents
    AC -.->|Coordinates| OrchestAgents
    DS -.->|Feeds| Coordination
